  "testimonial1Text": "\"The snorkeling tour in Cancún was extraordinary. The instructors were super patient and we got to see three giant sea turtles up close. The catamaran and Isla Mujeres are also a dream. I'll definitely be back with Attitour!\"",
  "testimonial1Location": "Spain",
  "testimonial2Text": "\"The Tulum and sacred cenote tour was amazing! The guide explained everything in great detail and the buffet lunch was delicious. We also swam in a mysterious natural cenote — a truly extraordinary experience. Highly recommend Attitour!\"",
  "testimonial2Location": "China",
  "testimonial3Text": "\"Contoy Island is an absolute paradise! It is completely untouched and wild. The number of nesting birds was incredible to see. Big thanks to the biologist guide for explaining the ecosystem so well. Worth every dollar.\"",
  "testimonial3Location": "United States"
